      "answer": "After post-training, GPT-4's calibration was significantly reduced, as indicated by the calibration plot showing a higher Expected Calibration Error (ECE) compared to the pre-trained model [D3]. The post-training process hurt calibration significantly, as demonstrated by the calibration curve for the post-trained GPT-4 model on the MMLU dataset [D2]. This reduction in calibration suggests that the model's confidence in its answers no longer closely matches the actual probability of being correct after post-training [D4]. The calibration plot for the pre-trained GPT-4 model showed high calibration, but this was not maintained after post-training [D3].",
