      "answer": "The difference between GPT-4-early and GPT-4-launch is that GPT-4-early is an early version fine-tuned for instruction following, while GPT-4-launch is a version fine-tuned for increased helpfulness and harmlessness, reflecting further mitigations outlined in the system card [D3]. GPT-4-launch is considered safer than GPT-4-early along various dimensions [D2]. The system card notes that GPT-4-launch still has remaining risks, as shown in example E3 [D5]. The system card is not comprehensive and expects to learn more over time [D2].",
